This project embeds Adobe's Adobe-GB1 character collection data:

Adobe-GB1 CID-to-Unicode table
Copyright 1990-2018 Adobe Systems Incorporated.

The data in cidmap/gb1_data.go is generated from Adobe's Adobe-GB1
CID-to-Unicode mapping and Adobe-GB1-UCS2 CMap as redistributed by poppler-data
(https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/poppler/poppler-data). The font-repair mapping
and the PDF text-extraction mapping retain their distinct results while sharing
the common data. Source hashes are recorded in cidmap/SHA256SUMS.

